      "subject": {
        "code": "mathematical_analysis",
        "chapter_code": "function_series"
      },
      "title": "含参数余弦级数在开区间上的一致收敛",
      "stem": "已知函数项级数\n$$\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\cos(n\\pi x)}{n^{ax}}$$\n关于 $x\\in(2,+\\infty)$ 一致收敛，求实数 $a$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_type": "proof",
      "difficulty_level": 4,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$a>\\dfrac12$。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "优级数充分性与尾和反例必要性",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "若 $a>1/2$，取 $1<\\sigma<2a$。对所有 $x>2$，$|\\cos(n\\pi x)n^{-ax}|\\le n^{-\\sigma}$，故由 Weierstrass 判别法一致收敛。反之，若 $a\\le0$，取 $x=4$ 时通项 $n^{-4a}$ 不趋于零。若 $0<a<1/2$，令 $x_N=2+1/(6N)$，对 $N\\le n\\le2N$ 有 $\\cos(n\\pi x_N)\\ge1/2$，尾和下界与 $N^{1-2a}$ 同阶，不能趋零。若 $a=1/2$，同一构造使指数为 $1+1/(12N)$，且 $\\sum_{n=N}^{2N}n^{-1-1/(12N)}$ 有与 $N$ 无关的正下界。因此一致 Cauchy 条件均失败。",
          "main_method_code": "uniform_cauchy_countersequence",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "在 $a>1/2$ 时选取 $1<\\sigma<2a$，用收敛的 $p$ 级数一致控制。",
              "method_code": "weierstrass_m_test"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "understand_problem",
              "text": "必要性不能只检查逐点收敛，还要检查开端点 $x\\downarrow2$ 附近的尾和。"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "取 $x_N=2+1/(6N)$，让 $N$ 到 $2N$ 的余弦项一致为正且远离零。",
              "method_code": "uniform_cauchy_countersequence"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "当 $a\\le1/2$ 时构造出的尾和不趋零，故充要条件为 $a>1/2$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "knowledge_points": [
