      "title": "有理函数反常积分的 Beta 函数求值",
      "stem": "计算\n$$\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{1+x^4}\\right)^2\\,dx.$$",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$\\dfrac{\\pi\\sqrt2}{16}$。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "化为 Beta 积分",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "原积分为 $I=\\int_0^\\infty x^4(1+x^4)^{-2}dx$。由 $\\int_0^\\infty x^{m-1}(1+x^q)^{-s}dx=q^{-1}B(m/q,s-m/q)$，取 $m=5,q=4,s=2$，得 $I=\\frac14B(5/4,3/4)=\\frac1{16}\\Gamma(1/4)\\Gamma(3/4)$。再用反射公式 $\\Gamma(z)\\Gamma(1-z)=\\pi/\\sin\\pi z$，得到 $I=\\pi\\sqrt2/16$。",
          "main_method_code": "beta_integral_evaluation",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "将被积式写为 $x^4/(1+x^4)^2$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "匹配 Beta 积分参数 $(m,q,s)=(5,4,2)$。",
              "method_code": "beta_integral_evaluation"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "用 Gamma 递推和反射公式化简为 $\\pi\\sqrt2/16$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
