      "title": "椭圆上的第二类曲线积分",
      "stem": "设椭圆 $C:x^2+4y^2=16$ 取逆时针方向，计算\n$$\\oint_C\\left(\\frac{xy^2}{x^2+2y^2+1}-y\\right)dx+\\left(x+\\frac{x^2y}{x^2+2y^2+1}\\right)dy.$$",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$16\\pi$。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "Green 公式与奇函数消项",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "记分母 $H=x^2+2y^2+1$。Green 公式中的旋度为 $2+2xy(2y^2-x^2)/H^2$。后一项关于 $x$ 为奇函数，而椭圆内部关于 $y$ 轴对称，故其二重积分为零。椭圆半轴为 $4,2$，面积 $8\\pi$，所以积分为 $2\\cdot8\\pi=16\\pi$。",
          "main_method_code": "green_formula_symmetry",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "用 Green 公式把闭曲线积分变成区域上的旋度积分。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "green_formula"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "求得旋度为 $2+2xy(2y^2-x^2)/H^2$。"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "由对称域上的奇函数积分为零，消去有理项。",
              "method_code": "green_formula_symmetry"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "剩余常数项积分等于两倍椭圆面积，即 $16\\pi$。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
