      "title": "sin(ln x) 的四阶 Peano 展开",
      "stem": "求 $\\sin(\\ln x)$ 在 $x=1$ 处带 Peano 余项的四阶 Taylor 展开式。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 2,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "$$\\sin(\\ln x)=(x-1)-\\frac12(x-1)^2+\\frac16(x-1)^3+o((x-1)^4).$$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "复合 Taylor 展开",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "令 $h=x-1$，则 $u=\\ln(1+h)=h-h^2/2+h^3/3-h^4/4+o(h^4)$，且 $\\sin u=u-u^3/6+o(u^4)$。计算 $u^3=h^3-3h^4/2+o(h^4)$ 后合并，四次项 $-h^4/4+h^4/4$ 抵消，得到答案。",
          "main_method_code": "compose_taylor_expansions",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "令 $h=x-1$，分别写出 $\\ln(1+h)$ 与 $\\sin u$ 的展开。"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "保留 $u^3$ 到四阶：$u^3=h^3-3h^4/2+o(h^4)$。",
              "method_code": "compose_taylor_expansions"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "合并同阶项，四阶系数为零。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
