      },
      "title": "由三个函数值确定二阶导数值",
      "stem": "设 $f\\in C[0,1]$，在 $(0,1)$ 上二阶可导，且\n$$f(0)=f(1)=0,\\qquad f(1/2)=1/4.$$\n证明存在 $\\xi\\in(0,1)$ 使 $f''(\\xi)=-2$。",
      "question_type": "proof",
      "difficulty_level": 2,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "standard",
          "answer_text": "结论成立；对 $g(x)=f(x)-x(1-x)$ 重复使用 Rolle 定理即可。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "匹配插值多项式并重复 Rolle 定理",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "令 $g(x)=f(x)-x(1-x)$，则 $g(0)=g(1/2)=g(1)=0$。分别在 $[0,1/2]$、$[1/2,1]$ 上用 Rolle 定理，得 $g'(\\eta_1)=g'(\\eta_2)=0$。再在 $[\\eta_1,\\eta_2]$ 上用 Rolle 定理，得到 $g''(\\xi)=0$。因 $g''=f''+2$，故 $f''(\\xi)=-2$。",
          "main_method_code": "auxiliary_function_repeated_rolle",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "构造与三个给定值匹配的二次函数 $x(1-x)$。",
              "method_code": "auxiliary_function_repeated_rolle"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "对差函数在两个小区间各用一次 Rolle 定理。"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "对两个一阶导数零点之间再用一次 Rolle 定理。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "rolle_theorem"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "由 $g''=f''+2$ 得结论。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "knowledge_points": [
